    "literal_utf8": "{\n  \"domain\": \"jitml-phase278-prospective-current-source-finite-criterion-judgment-draft-v1\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"algorithm\": 1,\n    \"sha256\": \"9b90cf0f171c41b900dc0452c438a6656a56f68a3a7ccb640b910b17ea2f48a5\"\n  },\n  \"lane\": \"apple-silicon\",\n  \"scope\": \"native\",\n  \"reviewer\": \"Codex /root/regression_math\",\n  \"reviewer_role_and_authorship\": \"I authored the approved generic regression training-order mechanism, complete descriptor, focused order unit controls/independent synthetic-vector derivation, private derivative preparer/templates, this completed actual-input record, full-source audit and this compatibility/draft note. Terminal authored Matrix/report semantic binding and identity tests and independently reviewed my mechanism/vectors; Root wired tests/Cabal, applied the exact HLint style expression, executed actual scoped controls/build/helper/export/docs operations and reviewed actual compiler inputs. Plan_audit authored helper tooling/governance work. I am the distinct draft/note author, not either future Root or Terminal criterion-assessment author. Both must separately assess exact draft bytes and disclose their roles; no author-independent whole-implementation approval or human scientific sign-off is asserted.\",\n  \"state\": \"PROSPECTIVE_DRAFT_PENDING_ROOT_AND_ANOTHER_AGENT_INDEPENDENT_ASSESSMENT\",\n  \"judgment\": \"The unchanged finite quality criterion is proposed for the exact new-source lane vector with the explicitly user-approved versioned regression training-order revision. Exactly2 California objects change and108 others remain exact; this is not an unchanged recipe or diagnosed bug repair. Independent exact assessments are pending; no outcome is asserted.\",\n  \"public_source_and_contract_export\": {\n    \"receipt\": {\n      \"path\": \".build/phase278-current/reg-ord1-linux-public-source-contract-export-20261025/receipt.json\",\n      \"bytes\": 3294,\n      \"sha256\": \"378cd62eb21a06